WEBVTT

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.230
<b>Planet Zi</b>

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.230
<b>Planet Zi</b>

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:40.080
<b><i>At the far side of the Milky Way is Planet Zi.</i></b>

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:47.610
<b><i>Here, metallic lifeforms exist, possessing unparalleled combat abilities.</i></b>

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:51.460
<b><i>Known as Zoids, these beings possess an inborn will to fight.</i></b>

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.950
<b>Guylos Empire</b>

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.950
<b>Guylos Empire</b>

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.040
<b><i>They are used as the ultimate weapon</i></b>

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.900
<b>Helic Republic</b>

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.900
<b>Helic Republic</b>

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:59.630
<b><i>in the ongoing war between the Empire and the Republic.</i></b>

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:06.560
<b><i>Van, a young Zoid-enthusiast born and raised on this world,</i></b>

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:12.310
<b><i>recently obtained Sieg, an Organoid with the power to fuse with other Zoids.</i></b>

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.780
<b><i>After a fateful encounter with a mysterious girl named Fiine,</i></b>

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.840
<b><i>he sets out on a journey in search of Fiine's past.</i></b>

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.330
<b>Wake Up, Sieg<b>!</b></b>

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:22.020
<b>Zoids-Anime Presents:</b>

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:25.330
<b>Zoids-Anime Presents:</b>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:32.820
Are you all right?

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.900
Medic! Medic!

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.480
Damn it.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.530
That was reckless.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.380
Well, I guess it couldn't be helped.

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:47.850
Anyone would have fallen into that trap.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.670
Fortunately, my unit wasn't hurt.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.180
After we have assessed the situation, we 
will begin preparation for the next strategy.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:03.600
It's a shame we lost the fortress, but at least we 
have temporarily halted the Imperial Forces' advance.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:08.570
Everything went according to your ingenious plan, Colonel Krueger.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.640
You won't get a pay raise even if you flatter me.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.990
No, I'm...

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:18.870
Nevermind. The question is how 
much time we've managed to buy.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:27.210
Considering the speed at which their reinforcements are advancing, they'll need time to reassemble their scattered troops.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:31.260
Additionally, it will take eight hours of rest to boost their morale.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:37.110
I think an experienced commander 
could get them back in about thirty hours.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:39.110
A-Are they really that fast?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.690
If it were my unit, they would be back within twenty four hours.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.630
Why are you spacing out here?

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.020
Hurry and get back to the Mount Ossai base.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.730
Prepare for the Imperial Forces' attack.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.420
Yes sir.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:59.940
I won't allow the forces of the Empire to set foot in New Helic City.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.020
I have to defeat them at Mount Ossai no matter what.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.670
Sorry, Sieg.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:23.500
You too, Shield Liger. With Sieg out of action, it's been in the same condition.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.760
We have anticipated this but...

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.800
There's nothing we can do without a single person here.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:33.010
Moonbay, isn't there anything you can do to wake Sieg up?

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:36.980
I have never seen these kind of symptoms in a Zoid before.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.690
There's nobody here?

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:44.680
There were doctors who specialized in Zoids in this town before.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:45.640
I see.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.700
How about just giving up and asking the Republic Forces for help?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.150
No way!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:54.530
We aren't getting involved with wars or the military anymore.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.540
That's a nice sentiment.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:06.630
I should never have gotten Sieg 
involved in fighting in the first place.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:12.630
There was no reason for us to fight.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:14.320
Van.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:17.600
Those are for humans. We can't give them to Sieg.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.560
We won't know if we don't try!

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.730
Van, calm down.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:26.730
Like I can stay calm with Sieg in that condition.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:37.340
Sorry, Van.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:44.250
Fiine.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:50.380
Once Sieg regains consciousness, I'm going back to the Wind Colony.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:51.680
Huh?

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.300
I'm ending the search for Zoid Eve.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:59.760
I don't want to endanger Sieg any more.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.480
I see.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:12.100
Then, how about just letting Sieg die?

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.520
What?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.390
Zoids are weapons.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.450
They exist for wars.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:20.700
You're wrong!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.570
I am not.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:27.780
Being a Zoid pilot means being a soldier.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:32.090
If you say you don't want to do that, then you don't need Sieg.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.250
Sieg is my partner!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:41.890
Isn't it your own lack of skill that got 
your cherished partner into that condition?

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.060
It's not the fault of wars or the military.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.690
And it's definitely not Fiine's fault!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.560
The fault is all yours!

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.770
If you want to quit and run away, fine - go by yourself.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:56.200
I'll take Sieg and Fiine with me.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:57.940
In your dreams!

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.820
You people are such a noisy bunch.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:07.460
Old man?

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.330
Dr. D!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:12.990
Are you guys talking or quarreling? I can't tell them apart.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.030
Both.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.270
Old man D. What are you doing here?

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.100
I came to buy some sunscreen.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.090
Note: hiyakedome is sunscreen, hiyake is sunburn

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.090
Sunburn?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:29.070
I had totally forgotten that snow reflects sunlight.

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:31.470
It's painful here.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.650
Oh yeah - old man...

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:36.070
You were a great scientist for the Republic Forces, right?

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.530
I don't recall saying that.

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.990
Whatever. I want you to look at something!

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:42.410
Wait!

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:49.850
I actually broke my leg, so go easy on me.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.050
How is he, old man?

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.570
Looks like it was reckless.

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:03.530
It's all my fault.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.450
Unless we take action, it won't ever wake up again.

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.770
W-What should I do?

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:11.050
Do you really want to save him?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.510
Of course!

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.360
Then go to that mountain.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.270
Mount Ossai?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:27.430
In that volcano, there is a shiny blue mineral called Zoimagnite.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:30.180
It will just need a bit.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:33.370
Feed the mineral to it.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.570
Will it regain consciousness?

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.290
Maybe.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:40.340
But hurry. By nightfall it will be too late.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:41.810
I understand.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.550
I believe in you.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.350
Like I thought, you used to be a great scientist.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.580
That's nonsense. I still am a great scientist.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.110
Fiine. I'm leaving Sieg in your care.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.310
Sure.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:58.480
Van, I'll give you a lift to Mount Ossai.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.520
Thank you! I owe you one.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:05.660
Irvine!

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.360
Don't you dare lay a finger on Sieg.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.660
I will be back soon!

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.200
Finally he's back to being himself.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.830
Well then, maybe I should get going...

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.740
I want to pay back a debt.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:26.510
Hey, rookie.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.850
Wait up. I mean you, rookie.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:34.040
What?

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:38.240
There is a multi-stage homing cluster 
missile system in the Republican base.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.860
It's an effective weapon against fast opponents.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:47.290
Tell them you are going to test it. 
Give them my name... they'll be happy to lend it to you.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.840
Really?

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.070
This isn't like you at all.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.670
If they won't, can't you just steal it?

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:56.510
That's true.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:00.370
I admire a man who enjoys a challenge.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:03.350
Now, hurry. Go before you change your mind.

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:07.440
I gladly accept your gift.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:19.530
So Krueger is the Republican Forces' commander?

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.830
I heard that he had retired.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:25.010
He resumed his position during this critical time.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.830
So, a veteran played an old trick, and you fell for it completely.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:31.110
I do not agree.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:36.250
Our primary target, Fort Cronos, is completely devastated.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:39.210
By costing you half of the Molga unit?

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:42.450
Well, take this as a lesson.

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:47.080
An inexperienced commander will not gain the full trust of those around him.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.890
Yes sir. I will take this valuable piece of advice to heart.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:55.820
It must be hard for you to become my subordinate again, after the long awaited promotion.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:11:02.480
Not at all. I will take the opportunity to observe your skill in the next attack, Major Schwarz.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.330
That's nice.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.550
Inform all platoons, we will commence our assault.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:13.330
Yes sir!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:29.260
Don't be so wound up.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:32.260
We aren't even close to the volcano.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.180
But...

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.870
You never change.

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:38.370
You haven't changed one bit since we first met.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:41.230
Like I can change so easily.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.170
That's what you think.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:47.310
You should at least have gotten a bit more 
mature after going through all these hardships.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.030
I know.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.350
Even if you don't tell me, I know.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.340
Next time I will finish them off for good.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.910
Stop! Who goes there?!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:35.790
I was asked by Dr. D to retrieve the experimental weapons.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.010
Excuse us for being so rude!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.750
We have been waiting for you.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.050
Thanks. I'm going in.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.450
That old man is really something.

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.610
It's really hot when we're this close.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:06.370
There's a lot of steam.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.340
I can't see a thing. What should we do?

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:09.290
Relax.

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.470
Phew. That's hot.

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:24.350
It's over a thousand degrees there.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:29.050
Even so, Zoimagnite...

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.930
I don't see a thing that looks like it.

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:34.010
No way. Look more carefully.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.300
Even if you say that...

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:37.690
Huh?

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.280
Found it!!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:42.590
There it is!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.130
But we can't reach it.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.590
Why?

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.460
W-What?

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:48.850
Because of this...

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:55.030
I-I-It's erupting?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.860
It's not erupting, but the magma is flaring up.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.540
Let's observe the intervals of the 
flaring, and not do anything reckless.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.150
There's no time, it's almost sunset!

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:10.800
I'm going!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.880
It's impossible!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.370
I don't care if it's impossible.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.570
There's no other way to save Sieg.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.050
Wait! Wait!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:19.880
Sheesh...

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.020
You just never listen.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:28.200
All right. I can finish that guy for good with this.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.260
What's that?

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.100
It seems like Dr. D's order.

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:36.040
Dr. D?

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:41.660
Colonel Krueger, that man is the Zoid pilot 
who caught the attention of Captain Hermann.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:45.990
Oh... He sure knows a lot of important people.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.570
Don't you think so?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.300
Yes.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:54.670
But why did he install that on the highly mobile Command Wolf?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:59.820
Could it be that he's going to fight against the Saber Tiger?

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:03.060
I see. That's Dr. D for you.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:08.730
Then, shall we install the same 
equipment on our Command Wolves?

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:11.180
It's no use. There is no need for that.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:15.770
This was originally made for use with the ZG.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:19.500
It's so heavy that it decreases a Zoid's 
maneuverability, making it hard to control.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:23.700
You can't handle it unless you have exceptional skills.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:24.530
That's true.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:28.600
Let's hope he can bring down the Saber Tiger.

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.320
It's hot.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.350
We're safe from the heat as long as we're inside the Gustav.

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:45.610
Is that so?

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:49.270
The Gustav can only go as far as those rocks.

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:50.600
After that...

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.710
A guest?

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.270
It's just small fry.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:11.620
What a disappointment.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.880
I will make you regret letting me go.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.520
What happened to the other guy?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.760
Don't tell me that he ran away in fear?

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.640
Or...

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:24.720
Has he died?

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.010
He has nothing to do with this.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:29.150
I will settle things with you.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.160
Isn't it already settled?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.480
I have no interest in winning one-sided fights.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.720
I've had enough of your nonsense.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.500
Get in your Saber Tiger right now!

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.160
It's hot!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:49.290
Moonbay, are you sure these suits are safe?

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:54.260
According to the manual, it can endure heat of up to 500 degrees for up to 20 minutes.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:58.150
More importantly, you need to pay 
attention to the movement of the magma.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:02.810
If we don't get out of here before it starts erupting,
we'll be toasted even in these heat-resistant suits.

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:04.690
Even the Gustav will be vaporized in an instant.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.220
I know.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.820
Van. It's just about five meters away. Can you see it?

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.670
I can't see a thing with all this steam.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.940
Okay. I see it.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.360
Just lower me down a bit more.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.390
Sure.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.740
All right. All right.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.530
Just like this. Stop!

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.770
Okay. I've got it!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.580
Moonbay, I've done it!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.690
I knew it.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.280
The heat-resistant suits were made in the Republic after all.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.850
Nevermind that, just get me out of here now!

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:53.440
Sure.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.440
I will bring this back even if I die.

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:02.440
It sure is hot!

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.310
Van, are you all right?

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:09.330
We can save Sieg now.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:10.850
Right.

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:11.760
No good!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:13.490
Van! Come back inside, quick!

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.380
The magma is flaring up!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:24.670
All right.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.830
With the range of these missiles you won't dodge them all.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:33.480
What?

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:39.430
I did it!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:58.630
I thought you just put on some weight, but you are starting to piss me off.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.030
What are you rambling about?

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.630
You're finished, Raven!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:04.640
I will finish you off cleanly.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:11.370
You don't know anything.

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.920
Shadow!

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.000
Is that the black Organoid?

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:30.980
What?

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.670
Damn it! To hell with these!

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:44.180
How can he move so fast?

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:49.400
You punk!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.110
Where is it? Where's the Saber Tiger?

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.380
Right here.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:14.750
Keep it up, Gustav!

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:15.930
Just a bit more.

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:21.420
At this rate...

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.550
Okay. Let's go!

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.940
All right! Pull us up!

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.200
We're saved...

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.440
At this level, that's nothing to talk about.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.630
You depend too much on your missiles.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:00.280
You punk!!

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.650
But you are good at escaping.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.370
Sieg, please open your eyes.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.020
Sieg.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:33.060
Sieg, please open your eyes.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:33.790
I'm begging you!

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:38.810
Sieg.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:42.250
We did it!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.760
It's regained consciousness.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.350
Can we relax now?

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:50.300
No. It still needs time to regain its strength.

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:55.300
I don't care. As long as Sieg... Sieg is alive.

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:25.110
Preview

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:27.360
Yo! I'm Van!

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:29.530
Irvine, where are you going?

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:32.080
You'll get caught up in the battle if you go there!

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:34.740
Huh? To pilot the 'ultimate weapon'?

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:38.170
Hey, could that be... a Gojulas?

00:23:38.380 --> 00:23:43.920
This time, the Imperial forces that were on hold 
are attacking the Republican forces at Mount Ossai!

00:23:44.660 --> 00:23:46.670
Next. Zoids Episode 15.

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:48.440
Deploy the ZG!

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:52.600
<b>Deploy the ZG!</b>

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:50.660
Next time, I'll sure be fired up too!
